'''Wigglytuff''' (Japanese: '''プクリン''' ''Pukurin'') is a {{ct|Colorless}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Shining Revelry}} expansion.

