==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Wigglytuff|135}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion.
*'''Gentle Slap''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Team Rocket Returns|Psyduck|70}} from the {{TCG|EX Team Rocket Returns}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Wigglytuff}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

